      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "To start a roof insurance claim in Utah, get a free, documented inspection from a licensed local roofing contractor before you call your insurer.",
        "snippet_links": [
          {
            "text": "get a free, documented inspection from a licensed local roofing contractor",
            "link": "https://authorityroof.com/roof-replacement-insurance-claims-utah/"
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Get an Independent Inspection: Hire a licensed Utah roofer to inspect the roof, take time-stamped photos, and determine if damage warrants a claim.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              1,
              6
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Review Policy Details: Check your date of loss, coverage type (RCV vs. ACV), and deductible amount.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              5,
              7
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "File the Claim: Contact your insurance company with the date of loss (e.g., specific windstorm or hail event) and your contractor's documentation.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              3,
              7
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Meet the Adjuster: Have your roofing contractor present on-site when the insurance adjuster walks the roof to ensure all damaged components and building codes are included in the scope.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              7,
              8
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Review the Scope & Payout:",
            "list": [
              {
                "snippet": "The insurer issues an initial ACV check upon approval."
              },
              {
                "snippet": "If the insurer's initial estimate misses damaged items or code requirements, your contractor can submit a supplemental claim.",
                "reference_indexes": [
                  1,
                  7,
                  9
                ]
              }
            ],
            "reference_indexes": [
              1,
              7,
              9
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Complete Repairs & Pay Deductible: You are legally required to pay your deductible; any contractor offering to waive your deductible is committing insurance fraud in Utah.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              1,
              9
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you want to narrow down your next steps, tell me:"
      }
    ],
